Selected button and tracking sprites are retained from the upstream asset
bundle: Capture (JailButton), Mark, Recall, Alert, Shoot (SheriffShootButton),
Arrow, and Beacon0–Beacon9 (EscapistMark_0–EscapistMark_9).
Role/button/options registration, meeting cleanup, Reactor RPC transport,
Mira custom murder/game-over integration, task counting, critical-sabotage
checks, and revive/presentation patterns were adapted and simplified from
Town of Us Mira and MiraAPI. This plugin does not include or link against
TownOfUsMira.dll. Role mechanics, host validation, UI, and presentation have
been substantially modified for AmongUsDogsRoles's nine-role roster.

Explode, Sniff, Execute, Release, Investigate, ChainLink, Fake, Unfake,
Blast0–Blast35 and Explosion.wav are original artwork/audio under this
mod's GPL-3.0 license. Their editable sources and generators are included.

